WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Try not to picture a white bear. For many people, the instruction brings the image closer, not farther away.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In 1987, researchers compared people asked to suppress that thought with people instructed differently.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A later review found rebound after suppression, but immediate effects depended partly on mental workload.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
That evidence explains an attention puzzle. It does not prove any meditation audio works.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
If you are considering guided listening, start with a free twelve-minute observation.

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Then inspect the exact offer, limits, and refund terms.
